# No-Code CS admin (product overlay)

When adding or editing staff tooling for customer service on this product:

1. Put curated assists on **`/admin`** (CS / Ops / Messages tabs as appropriate).
2. Do **not** make `/dev` the CS primary surface.
3. Gate destructive privacy/ops mutates to `cs_lead` / `eng` (or product equivalents).
4. Write `AdminAuditLog` (or product equivalent) on every mutate.
5. Keep product no-code audit docs current when capabilities ship.

Full Labs rule: ALGR principle `no-code-cs-admin`. Playbook: `docs/prompts/no-code-cs-admin.md`.
